--- Integration model (precedent: DigitalTwinWidget 0036, BatteryCellsWidget 0010) ---
The staged dir apps/apple/TeslaSync/dashboard-widgets/ is intentionally NOT registered in project.yml.
Each staged surface is self-contained and redefines the small registry value types
(DashboardWidgetSize / DashboardWidgetRegistration). It CANNOT be added to the TeslaSync target as-is
because Sources/DashboardWidgets/BatteryCellsWidgetRegistry.swift already declares DashboardWidgetSize in
that module (duplicate-symbol). Target registration is a deliberate later reconciliation step.
Consequence: `xcodebuild build` compiles the app WITHOUT this widget (regression/integration check), and the
widget itself is compiled + unit-tested in ISOLATION via a SwiftPM harness (module named TeslaSync so
`@testable import TeslaSync` resolves) that vendors the REAL design tokens (apps/design/generated/apple/
Tokens.swift) + the REAL TSSkeleton. This is stronger evidence than the 0036 precedent (which deferred the
Xcode build/test entirely).

